{"about_the_game":"Space Ops VR is not just a game, but a real-time training program for special operatives set in outer space! Do you dare to join this team of elites? <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1045110/extras/09eeff42a8b9ae9e7e6838cd132874da.poster.avif?t=1574588390\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1045110/extras/09eeff42a8b9ae9e7e6838cd132874da.webm?t=1574588390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1045110/extras/09eeff42a8b9ae9e7e6838cd132874da.mp4?t=1574588390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You are put  in the shoes of a rookie who has just enrolled for basic training to become a part of the special ops team, whose main aim is to ensure the safety of a dangerous  deep-space expedition. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1045110/extras/0bcbe931ec34264954fbd51d02d33566.poster.avif?t=1574588390\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1045110/extras/0bcbe931ec34264954fbd51d02d33566.webm?t=1574588390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1045110/extras/0bcbe931ec34264954fbd51d02d33566.mp4?t=1574588390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fight  a lone wolf, alongside your  friends in co-op, or hone your skills in  player-versus-player  matches: Find out who\u2019s  ready for the real battlefield. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1045110/extras/3b06ce4a6790a3b42bba7c0dc1c26b0f.poster.avif?t=1574588390\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1045110/extras/3b06ce4a6790a3b42bba7c0dc1c26b0f.webm?t=1574588390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1045110/extras/3b06ce4a6790a3b42bba7c0dc1c26b0f.mp4?t=1574588390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Test yourself in the harsh environments of outworld deserts, compete with other rookies in the fight against aliens, and prove to your drill instructor that you\u2019re the toughest! <br>So...show me your war face!You belong to Space Ops now!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Extended coop experience<br></li><li>Advanced skill-based matchmaking <br></li><li>Competitive PvE/PvP gameplay<br></li><li>Daily Quests<br></li><li>Survival mode<br></li><li>Unique futuristic weapons, with different damage types such as Kinetic, Beam, and Plasma. <br></li><li>Tons of grenades and gadgets to send your foes flying and make the enemies wet themselves <br></li><li>Customizable characters <br></li><li>Unique teleportation system to help you save your soul - or doom you - depending on the decisions you make</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Space ops: Reloaded contains:</h2> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>4 Challenge missions that can be played in single, co-op or versus modes.<br></li><li>3 Survival missions that can be played in single or co-op modes.<br></li><li>5 Special Operations to play in single or co-op modes. <br></li><li>A total of 12 different missions<br></li><li>Dozens of side missions with epic rewards<br><br>Available for arcade on SpringboardVR</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"00c9643fe0f358e39d26ba1b56a1995d5292d948.jpg","localized_name":"Guardian angel","name":"Guardian angel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1045110/00c9643fe0f358e39d26ba1b56a1995d5292d948.jpg"},{"icon":"2bde85c644d